Cell["\<\
ToDos:
Refactor DSEPlotGraph to be used in DSEGraphPlotList.
Permutations: extend to props.
Diag 5 in prop makes problems. Is in identifyGraphs, so maybe skip and wait \
if I can generalize identifyGraphsViaGraphs.
Prop derivs do not contain permutations.\
\>", "Text",
